 con contraseña",title:"Password protect"},saveRotatedPagesModal:{text:"To continue you must save the file",title:"Save file"},saveSuccess:"Saved changes.",shareModal:{sendByEmail:{description:"Send document by email",labelEmail:"Send to",labelFileName:"Document Name",labelMessage:"Message",mobileDescription:"Select an action to perform on the document",placeholderEmail:"name@email.com",placeholderFileName:"pdf-name.pdf",placeholderMessage:"Write your message here...",successToast:"Email sent",title:"Send document by email"}},sidebar:{additionalLayers:"Additional Layers",addPage:"Add page",attachments:"Attachments",join:"Join",joinPdf:"Join PDF",layers:"Layers",moveLeft:"Move left",moveRight:"Move right",newNote:"New note",reorder:"Reorder",rotateLeft:"Rotate left",rotateRight:"Rotate right",sortPages:"Sort pages",thumbnails:"Thumbnails",transparent:"Transparent",writeNoteHere:"Write Here"},tapInScreen:"Tap on screen",toolbar:{addImage:"Add Image",addText:"Add text",brush:"Brush",color:"Color",compress:"Compress",disabled:"Functionallity not compatible with your browser or operating system. Update it to enable its use.",editObjects:"Edit objects",editText:"Edit text",eraser:"Eraser",fillColor:"Fill Color",find:"Find",format:"Format",handTool:"Move",highlight:"Highlight",highlightColor:"Highlight color",image:"Image",moreTools:"More",nextPage:"Next page",notes:"Notes",opacity:"Opacity",previousPage:"Previous page",protect:"Protect",redo:"Redo",selectionTool:"Pointer",shapes:"Shapes",shapeType:"Shape type",showAll:"Show all",sign:"Sign",stroke:"Stroke",style:"Style",thickness:"Thickness",undo:"Undo",zoomActual:"Real size",zoomAuto:"Auto Size",zoomFit:"Page Setup",zoomIn:"Increase",zoomOut:"Reduce",zoomWidth:"Page width"},unsavedChangesModal:{confirmText:"Yes, exit",text:`If you exit the editor you will lose your progress.
Are you sure?`,title:"Exit editor"}},aC={accountDeleted:"This account has been deleted and can’t be added.",captchaVerificationFailed:"Captcha verification failed",emailExists:"The email is already registered",emailInvalid:"Invalid Email",forbidden:"You don't have the right permissions to access the content.",generic:"Oops! An error occurred.",tooManyRequests:"You have reached the request limit, please try again in 1 minute",userAccountClosed:"This account has been deleted and can’t be added.",userAlreadyExists:"User already exists"},oC={description:"If you have any questions that cannot be answered with our FAQs, please feel free to contact our team.",items:[{answer:"PDFe lets you edit text and images, convert PDF to Word or Excel, sign documents, add visual elements, and password-protect files. All right from your browser, with no software installation required. Unlike other platforms, you can start using most features without registering or downloading any software.",question:"What does PDFe offer and how is it different from other platforms?"},{answer:"You can use most of the editor's features for free, such as editing text, adding images, shapes, or signatures. But if you want to download, share, or convert documents, you'll need a trial plan or a monthly subscription.",question:"Can I use PDFe for free or do I need a subscription?"},{answer:"For 7 days, you can edit up to 3 documents per day and download them in the format of your choice (Word, Excel, JPG, among others). You'll have full access to the editor to modify text, add content, insert images or shapes, and rearrange pages. Files will be available for 24 hours from the moment you upload them, and you can also share them using a viewing link.",question:"What does the trial plan include?"},{answer:"If you reach the document limit on the trial plan, you won't be able to download, share, or convert any more files that day. You can wait until the next day for the daily limit to renew or upgrade to a monthly subscription to use all the features without restrictions.",question:"What happens if I exceed the trial plan limit?"},{answer:"Yes, you can edit a PDF by modifying the text, correcting errors, moving elements, and adding or removing images as needed.",question:"Can I edit text and images in a PDF?"},{answer:"You can convert Word, Excel, PowerPoint documents, and images in formats like JPG or PNG to PDF. You can also do the reverse conversion: transform PDF files into those same formats.",question:"What file formats can I convert to or from a PDF?"},{answer:"To convert a PDF file to other formats like Word or Excel, just upload it, click “Download”, choose the format you need, and in just a few seconds you'll have your document ready to use.",question:"How to easily convert a PDF to Word or Excel?"},{answer:"Yes, you can fill out interactive forms directly from the platform. Just upload the file and complete the available fields, such as text, checkboxes, or drop-down menus. It's ideal for completing applications, administrative forms, or surveys without having to print anything.",question:"Can I work with interactive forms in PDF?"},{answer:"Yes, you can sign PDF documents by adding your digital signature, drawing it with the mouse, or uploading an image of your signature.",question:"Can I sign documents on the platform?"},{answer:"Yes, you can set a password to protect your PDF document and restrict access to the file.",question:"Can I password-protect my PDFs?"},{answer:"Yes, you can share your documents with others and assign different access levels: administrator (with full control), collaborator (with editing permissions), or limited (read and download only). This way, multiple users can work together on the same PDF, adding content or notes visible to all participants.",question:"Can I collaborate with others on a PDF?"},{answer:"You can generate a link so other people can view the edited document directly from the browser, without having to download or edit it. If you want them to be able to make changes or add comments, you'll need to add them as collaborators.",question:"How can I share an edited PDF with someone else?"},{answer:"All files are transferred over an encrypted connection and stored securely. In the trial version, documents are automatically deleted after 24 hours. With a monthly subscription, you can access your files at any time and manually delete them whenever you need from your account.",question:"How is the security of my files protected?"},{answer:"Files are kept available for 24 hours if you're using the trial version. With a monthly subscription, they remain stored indefinitely, and you can delete them whenever you want from your account.",question:"How long are edited files stored on the platform?"},{answer:"Yes, the platform is designed to work from any browser, whether on a mobile phone, tablet, or computer, allowing you to edit and manage your documents from anywhere.",question:"Can I use this tool from a mobile phone or tablet?"}],title:"Frequent questions"},iC={button:{compress:"Pay and download",download:"Pay and download",notes:"Pay and add notes",share:"Pay and share"},header:{compress:"Your document is ready!",download:"Your document is ready!",notes:"Add notes to your document",share:"Share your document"},plans:{disclaimer:"{{dayLimit}} documents per day",subtitle:"Amount to be paid",title:{compress:"One step left to get your document",download:"One step left to get your document",notes:"One step left to add notes to your document",share:"One step left to share your document"}},trialDiscount:"100% Discount"},sC={title:"Start for free now!"},lC={faqSection:{faqs:[{answer:["On our platform, you can edit a PDF file directly from your browser, without installing any software or creating an account. Simply upload your file and access a wide variety of editing tools, including:",{items:["Add text anywhere in the document.","Highlight fragments, cross out or underline text.","Insert notes, comments, or freehand drawings.","Rearrange, delete, or rotate pages in the PDF.","Sign the document with your name, an image, or by drawing with the cursor.","Add images or replace text."],type:"unordered"},"You can use all the tools for free while editing your file. To download the document with the changes applied, you can access a 7-day trial plan for just €1, or subscribe to the monthly plan for continuous use.","In addition to the editing tools, you'll also be able to:",{items:["Convert Word, Excel, PowerPoint, or image files to PDF.","Combine multiple files into a single PDF.","Split a PDF document into multiple parts.","Password protect PDF files.","Share your document via link or email.","Insert new pages or move existing ones within the file."],type:"unordered"},"You can use our tool directly from your browser or access it from your Windows, macOS, or mobile device to edit your PDF documents wherever and whenever you need."],question:"What tools can I use to edit a PDF online for free?"},{answer:["Yes, you can easily share your edited PDF file. Once you're finished editing, you can download the document and email it, or generate a shareable link directly from your browser—no attachments or software installation required.","Additionally, you can enable shared editing and add notes or comments to work collaboratively with other users, whether from a computer, tablet, or mobile device."],question:"How can I share a PDF once it's been edited?"},{answer:["Editing a PDF file from your browser is very easy and doesn't require any software installation. Just follow these steps:",{items:["Upload the PDF file you want to edit.","Use our online tools to add text, highlight, rearrange pages, sign your document, insert images, and more.","Once you're done editing, sign in to save your file.","Get a 7-day trial for just €1 or subscribe to download your edited PDF."],type:"ordered"},"You can do it all from your browser, without installing any software, and from any device. Editing PDFs online has never been easier."],question:"How to edit a PDF online without installing any software?"},{answer:["Yes, you can edit PDF files directly from Google Chrome without installing any extensions. Our platform is fully compatible with Google Chrome and other browsers. Simply upload your file to start editing: add text, sign the document, move pages, or insert images—no extensions or software downloads required."],question:"Can I edit a PDF using Google Chrome?"},{answer:["If your PDF file was created digitally (for example, from Word or Excel), you can easily edit it on our platform: add text, sign, move pages, or insert images.","However, if it's a scanned document or image, it can't be edited as text. Although we don't offer OCR technology, you can add content on top of the PDF with text boxes, annotations, and visual elements as an alternative to modifying it."],question:"How to make a PDF file editable?"},{answer:["You can edit a PDF for free directly from your browser, without installing any software or creating an account. Just follow these steps:",{items:["Upload the PDF file you want to modify.","Use our tools to add text, move pages, highlight content, insert images, or sign your document.","When you're done, sign up for a 7-day trial for just €1 to download the file with all the changes applied."],type:"ordered"},"The entire editing process is free. You only pay if you want to save or download the edited document."],question:"How to edit a PDF for free online?"}],subtitle:"Learn more about how to edit PDFs and use our features effectively",title:`Have questions?
We've got answers`},howTo:{steps:[{description:"Drag and drop your PDF or select it from your device.",title:"Upload your file"},{description:"Edit the text, add your signature, or convert your PDF to a different format.",title:"Make edits"},{description:"Get your updated file instantly, ready to print or share.",title:"Download your PDF"}],subtitle:"Follow these quick steps to edit your PDF files:",title:"How to edit PDFs online in 3 simple steps"},subtitle:"Convert, edit, and sign your PDFs effortlessly from any device.",title:"Free Online PDF Editor",tools:{convertFromPdf:"Convert from PDF",convertToPdf:"Convert to PDF",editAndSign:"Edit and sign",options:{annotate:"Annotate and collaborate",convert:"Convert files to PDF",editImage:"Modify images and elements",editText:"Edit text effortlessly",fromTo:"{{fromType}} to {{toType}}",organize:"Organize pages",protect:"Protect files with password",share:"Share documents easily",signature:"Add signatures to PDF"},subtitle:"From converting files to signing and protecting your PDFs, everything is here:",title:"All the tools you need to edit PDFs"},uploadPDF:{description:"Up to {{maxSize}} MB",file:"Drop your PDF file",or:"or"},whyPDFe:{reasons:[{description:"Maintain formatting and quality with every conversion, ensuring your files look exactly as you need. Convert PDF to Word, transform PowerPoint presentations into PDF, or export Excel spreadsheets without losing the original layout. You can also convert JPG images to PDF and consolidate everything into a single, professional file. Our PDF editor is designed to offer fast, accurate conversions that support the most commonly used formats.",subtitle:"Switch between Word, Excel, PowerPoint, images, and PDF files effortlessly.",title:"Convert files without complications"},{description:"Adjust alignment, size, and color to perfectly match your document's design. Edit text in PDF files directly from your browser, no software download required. Our online PDF editor lets you customize content, correct errors, or update data in seconds. Whether you need to customize a contract, update a form, or simply edit a PDF file, you'll have complete control over your content.",subtitle:"Replace or add text to your PDF files with fully customizable fonts and styles.",title:"Edit text with ease"},{description:"Adding an electronic signature to a PDF file without printing or scanning has never been easier. With our editor, you can sign and share documents digitally from any device. Whether it's contracts, agreements, forms, or any other PDF file, you can sign them online in seconds and send them directly from the platform.",subtitle:"Sign a PDF online by using your cursor, typing your name, or uploading an image as a digital signature.",title:"Sign documents securely"},{description:"You can share a PDF online via email or link, add comments and notes to your PDFs, and allow others to edit the file whenever they need to. Collaborate on PDFs from any device, access updated content, and edit documents online without losing the original formatting.",subtitle:"Allows other users to review and edit shared PDF files without installing any software.",title:"Collaborate on documents"}],subtitle:"Discover why we're the best choice for editing PDFs:",title:"Why choose our PDF Editor?"}},cC={lastUpdated:"Last updated: {{date}}"},uC={createNew:"Create New",document:"PDF Document",documents:{button:"Upload PDF",empty:"Here you can manage your documents",title:"Documents"},folder:"Folder",folders:{button:"Create Folder",editName:"Edit name",empty:"Here you can manage your folders",goToFolder:"Go to folder {{folderName}}",moreOptions:"Folder Options for {{folderName}}",title:"Folders"},limitedPlan:{button:"Upgrade now",description:"Upgrade your plan to enjoy unlimited document processing and extended storage.",dialog:{guestText:"You've reached your free document processing limit. Subscribe to any of our plans to continue using the platform.",subtitle:"Unlock unlimited PDF creation",text:"Your current plan allows a limited number of PDF files per day. Upgrade now to enjoy unrestricted access and create as many PDF files as you need.",title:"You have reached the limit"},guestButton:"Subscribe",guestDescription:"Subscribe to edit, save and download your PDFs without restrictions.",guestTitle:"Make the most of your account",title:"Unlock more features!"},mobileHeader:"Select all",modals:{download:{alertDOC:"When downloading as Word, your edits won’t be included. Only the original file is converted.",alertPDF:"Files with a password can only be exported in PDF format.",description:"Choose a format to download the selected file.",formats:{doc:{description:"Text File"},docx:{description:"Text File"},jpg:{description:"Standard image file"},pdf:{description:"Universal file format"},png:{description:"Image file with transparent background"},ppt:{description:"Slideshow Archive"},xls:{description:"Tabulated file"}},labelFileName:"File name",title:"Download as..."},editFolderName:{description:`The folder name will be updated. 
